@archive 0003
@size 5

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"우와… 여긴 어디야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"온통 별 천지야…\n이런 곳은\n처음 봐."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"태양계를 벗어나서\n우리 은하의 중심에"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"와 있는 것\n같아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"너희 과학자들은\n이곳을 “심우주”라고 부르겠지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이상하게도 이곳은\n왠지 익숙하게 느껴져."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"…응?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"이제 기억났어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"다이고와 그 일행이\n통신용 웨이브 로드를\n"
	cmdE264
	"까지 만든 곳이야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이 전파탑은\n많이 낡아 보이지만,\n틀림없어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이 웨이브 로드는\nFM 성인의 별로 이어져!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"…워록! 큰일이야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"응? 뭐가?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"생각해 봐."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"우린 “R” 녀석들이 지나간\n길을 따라 여기까지 왔어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그렇다면 녀석들과 그 우두머리가\n침공 중인 별은\nFM 성인의 별이라는 뜻이야…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = None
	"드디어 여기까지\n왔군…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"말하는 녀석이\n엄청난 기운을 뿜고 있어, 꼬맹이!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"“R” 녀석일 수도 있어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"아니면 그 우두머리일지도!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 3 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"너희들!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"너희가 "
	cmdE261
	"이구나!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = PegasusMagic
	"워록…\n우릴 적처럼 대하는 건\n기분 나쁘군."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"너희 꼴을 보면\n어쩔 수 없잖아!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = LeoKingdom
	"다음 이야기로 넘어가지…\n호시카와 스바루… 록맨…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"네?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DragonSky
	"네가 생각한 대로다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"FM 성인의 별은 지금\n멸망 직전에 놓여 있다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = PegasusMagic
	"너의 브라더, "
	cmdE262
	"\nFM 왕이 다른 FM 성인들과 함께"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"필사적으로 싸우고\n있다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"상황은 좋지 않다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"세페우스…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그렇다면 지구에 온\n아스트로 허츠는 우릴 찾으러\n보내진 거였군…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"그리고 너희는 도우러\n가는 중이고, 그렇지?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = LeoKingdom
	"도울 수 있다면\n당연히 그렇게 하겠지만…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"적이 별 전체를\n전파 장벽으로 둘러싸\n버렸다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"전투에 합류하러\n안으로 들어갈 수가 없어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	cmdE263
	"의 세 현자도\n뚫지 못하는 장벽이 있다니\n믿을 수가 없군."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그 “R” 녀석들의 우두머리가\n누군지 알아?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"알고 있다면 제발 말해 줘!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DragonSky
	"이름은 “시리우스”다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"“시리우스”…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DragonSky
	"그에 대한 데이터는\n극히 부족하다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"모든 것을 파괴하려\n한다는 이야기는\n들었어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = PegasusMagic
	"그래…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"시리우스는 블랙홀을\n조종하는 능력을 지니고 있다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"블랙홀을!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = LeoKingdom
	"시리우스의 표적이 된 별은\n블랙홀에 삼켜져"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"완전히 사라져\n버린다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"블랙홀은 원래 조종할\n수 있는 게\n아니잖아?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DragonSky
	"아니, 하지만 시리우스라면\n가능하다. 어떻게 하는지는 우리도\n모른다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"블랙홀을 막으려면\n어떻게 해야 해?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DragonSky
	"안타깝게도…\n우리도 방법을 모른다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"그렇구나…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = PegasusMagic
	"하지만 한 가지\n알려 줄 수 있는 사실이 있다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"“R”이라는 이름을 가진 존재가 아닌\n매우 강력한 전파 생명체가\nFM 성인의 별 근처에서 목격됐다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"현재 그 행방은\n알 수 없다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = LeoKingdom
	"노이즈의 흐름에\n휩쓸려 갔을지도 모르지…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그 존재는 네가 지금까지\n싸워 온 그 무엇보다도\n강력했다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DragonSky
	"시리우스와 “R”에 정신을\n쏟다가 기습당하지 않도록\n조심해라."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"고마워!\n조심할게!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = PegasusMagic
	"FM 왕… 세페우스는\n네가 도우러 오기를 기대하며\n싸우고 있다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"알겠어.\n브라더를 돕기 위해서라면\n무슨 일이든 할게!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = LeoKingdom
	"워록…\n호시카와 스바루를 부탁한다…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"그건 나도 잘 알고 있어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"너희가 오지 못한 몫까지\n내가 두 배로\n날뛰어 주겠어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DragonSky
	"좋아…\n록맨…\n너를 믿겠다…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 4 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"이 녀석이 블랙홀을\n조종한다는 거지?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그런 녀석을\n그냥 내버려 둘 순 없어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"가자, 꼬맹이!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"좋아!\n세페우스도 구하고…\nFM 성인의 별도 구하자!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
